      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-10-28T14:19:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Animal Control: Your summoned minion is one from the environment that you are controlling for the scene duration</p>\n<p>Cold/Electricity/Fire/Weather: You summon an elemental from the environment to aid you for the scene duration</p>\n<p>Materials: You temporarily bind a nature spirit into a form of some material, enabling it to assist you for the scene duration.</p>\n<p>Edit: I thought you were referring specifically to the Nature Power Source, but it gives you a couple of options to work with. There's also the Minion-Maker Archetype, or the Summoned Allies Red Zone ability. Summoned Allies comes from the Elemental/Energy, Materials, Psychic, and Self Control Powers.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:41.616Z",
